// /.well-known/knowledge-linkset, against AGSC-06-07…10, AGSC-06-08a, AGSC-06-35 and
// AGSC-11-16; with --peer, the mutual-conformance check of AGSC-10-12. Node stdlib
// only, zero dependencies, standalone (AGSC-09-90). Output: the AGSC-09-11 envelope
// under --json, one line per finding otherwise. Exit 0 pass, 1 fail, 2 usage.
